{
  "version": 1,
  "language": "ru",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "gate_intro_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "intro",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Наталья добралась до городка как раз вовремя: здесь уже возникла небольшая проблема. Ростом примерно по колено.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_intro_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Почему вы его не пропускаете?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_02",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Подвесной мост. По одному посетителю за раз. Каждый отмечается в журнале.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_03",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "У него нет рук. Отпечаток подойдёт?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_04",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Подойдёт. Только он прыгает. Я наклоняюсь посмотреть. Он перестаёт прыгать. Я выпрямляюсь. Он прыгает.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_05",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Вот.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_06",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Я ему помогу.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_07",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Хорошо. Только сначала нужен ключ. Лесничий забрал его, когда проверял крепления на другом берегу.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_08",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Где он теперь?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_09",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Ушёл к озеру проверять туристов. Обещал вернуться до обеда.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_10",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Давно?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_11",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Вчера утром.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_12",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "И вы его не искали?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_13",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Отправил помощника. Тот вернулся с запиской: «Все найдены, остаюсь ночевать».",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_14",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "А ключ почему не передал?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_15",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Вот это и хочу узнать. Сходите, пожалуйста, к лагерю. Кругом по тропе можно, только далековато.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_16",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Схожу. А ты подожди здесь.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_greeting_17",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "greeting",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Прыг согласился. Или предложил прыгнуть. В любом случае далеко не ушёл.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_greeting_17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_recovered_first_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "recovered_first",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "alternate",
      "text": "Ключ вернулся! Осталось помочь нашему посетителю с журналом.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_recovered_first_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_river_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "river",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Вода проходит без подписи. Наталья решает пока не сообщать об этом смотрителю.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_river_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_desk_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "desk",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Стол установлен на удобной высоте. Для смотрителя. Остальным предлагается расти.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_desk_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_mug_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "mug",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Кружка стоит точно на своём отпечатке. Дело раскрыто. Наталья решает не отвлекать следствие.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_mug_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_pryg_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "pryg",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Небольшое, круглое, упругое. Имя «Прыг» напрашивается само и несколько раз подтверждается.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_pryg_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_gate_locked_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "gate_locked",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "mode": "reaction",
      "text": "Ключ у лесничего. По тропе слева можно обойти, но этот малыш всё время скачет обратно к мосту.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_gate_locked_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_gate_hint_01",
      "scene": "gate",
      "block": "gate_hint",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "hint",
      "text": "Тропа слева ведёт к лагерю у озера.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/gate_gate_hint_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Вас искал лесничий.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_02",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "anton",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Нашёл ещё вчера. Переночевал, а утром решил проверить дальний берег.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_03",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "danka",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Вон его лодка. В камышах.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_04",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Он застрял?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_05",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "anton",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Похоже. У него длинная причальная верёвка. Если бросит конец, вытащим.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_06",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Бросайте верёвку!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_07",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "anton",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Ветер относит голос. У нас условный сигнал: три удара колокола означают «бросай верёвку». Вчера договорились, когда лодку причаливали.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_08",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "А колокол?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_09",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "anton",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Утром у него язык треснул. На солнечную пристань отнесли чинить.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_arrival_10",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Принесу.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_arrival_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_early_arrival_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "early_arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "alternate",
      "text": "Что там с лодкой?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_early_arrival_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_winter_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "winter",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Родители опять волнуются?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_winter_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_winter_02",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "winter",
      "speaker": "anton",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Мы передали, что у нас тепло.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_winter_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_winter_03",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "winter",
      "speaker": "sasha",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Теперь надо передать, что лесничему тоже.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_winter_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_dance_offer_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "dance_offer",
      "speaker": "vinnik",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Натка! Иди сюда!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_dance_offer_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_dance_offer_02",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "dance_offer",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Я лесничего спасаю.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_dance_offer_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_dance_offer_03",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "dance_offer",
      "speaker": "vinnik",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Тогда сначала вытащи. Потом потанцуем.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_dance_offer_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_dance_after_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "dance_after",
      "speaker": "vinnik",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Теперь один танец?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_dance_after_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_dance_after_02",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "dance_after",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Один.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_dance_after_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_hook_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "hook",
      "speaker": "katya",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Тут крючок!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_hook_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_hook_02",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "hook",
      "speaker": "alsu",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "На нём как раз можно подвесить колокол.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_hook_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_hook_03",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "hook",
      "speaker": "sanka",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "А меня?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_hook_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_hook_04",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "hook",
      "speaker": "alsu",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Для тебя нужен другой проект.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_hook_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_tent_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "tent",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "В палатке есть всё необходимое для жизни. Если понадобится что-нибудь ещё, Антон объяснит, почему это необязательно.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_tent_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_fire_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "fire",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Костёр развели сообща. Поэтому теперь каждый знает, как его следовало разводить.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_fire_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_pot_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "pot",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "По запаху готово. По мнению Антона, ещё пять минут. Наталья больше доверяет запаху.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_pot_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_drawing_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "drawing",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "Проект навеса. Санька уже пририсовал башню. Алсу пока не видела.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_drawing_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_lisbon_map_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "lisbon_map",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "optional",
      "text": "На карте дорога совершенно ровная. Наталья помнит эту дорогу. Карту составлял человек, который по ней не бегал.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_lisbon_map_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "camp_bell_hint_01",
      "scene": "camp",
      "block": "bell_hint",
      "speaker": "anton",
      "mode": "hint",
      "text": "Колокол на солнечной пристани. Дорожка вдоль воды.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/camp_bell_hint_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_arrival_01",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Пап, где колокол?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_arrival_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_arrival_02",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "У причала. На верёвке.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_arrival_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_arrival_03",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Он на дне.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_arrival_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_arrival_04",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Доска, значит, не выдержала. Я его на край положил.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_arrival_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_arrival_05",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Хорошо, что привязал.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_arrival_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_arrival_06",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "arrival",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Я же рыбак.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_arrival_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_early_01",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "early",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "alternate",
      "text": "Пап, что за верёвка у причала?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_early_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_early_02",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "early",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "alternate",
      "text": "Колокол. Принесли чинить.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_early_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rod_request_01",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rod_request",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Можно удочку?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rod_request_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rod_request_02",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rod_request",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "Сейчас, тут ладья под боем…",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rod_request_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rod_request_03",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rod_request",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "mode": "core",
      "text": "На доске осталось три фигуры. Каждая требует отдельной минутки.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rod_request_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rook_01",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rook",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "branch",
      "text": "У тебя ладью забирают.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rook_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rook_02",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rook",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "branch",
      "text": "Кто?!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rook_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rook_03",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rook",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "branch",
      "text": "Никто. Можно удочку?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rook_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_rook_04",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "rook",
      "speaker": "sergey",
      "mode": "branch",
      "text": "Бери. Только ладью не трогай.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_rook_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_dragon_01",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "dragon",
      "speaker": "nata",
      "mode": "branch",
      "text": "Пап, там дракон.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/voice/shore_dragon_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shore_dragon_02",
      "scene": "shore",
      "block": "dragon",
